# Google Analytics (GA4) measurement ID.
# Not read at runtime by the site itself — this is a static site with no
# server. The value is instead stored as a Cloudflare Pages environment
# variable named GA_MEASUREMENT_ID (Project → Settings → Environment
# variables) and gets substituted into the __GA_MEASUREMENT_ID__ placeholder
# in index.html and en/index.html by build.sh, which Cloudflare Pages runs
# as the project's build command.
GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
